---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Azure | DE-Coded Lab" description="Azure Data Factory, Synapse, and data lake architecture.">
  <div slot="hero" class="container hero-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Azure Data Engineering</p>
    <h1>Build robust data platforms on Azure</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Pipelines, storage patterns, and analytics architecture for production-ready systems.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="section-block">
    <h2>ADF orchestration</h2>
    <p>Design parent-child pipelines, retry strategies, and execution flows that stay maintainable.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section-block">
    <h2>Synapse workflows</h2>
    <p>Combine SQL pools, notebooks, and orchestration for integrated analytics workloads.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section-block">
    <h2>Storage architecture</h2>
    <p>Use Blob, ADLS Gen2, and Delta conventions with clean partitioning and governance boundaries.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

